{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":14347,\"date\":\"2026-04-19T16:02:45+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-19T14:02:45+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-fine-era-intel-solo-apple-silicon\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: fine dell’era Intel, solo Apple silicon\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha indicato che macOS 27 sarà compatibile solo con Mac Apple silicon. macOS 26 Tahoe sarà l’ultima versione principale per i Mac Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14213,\"date\":\"2026-04-11T15:00:55+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-11T13:00:55+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-macos-tahoe-26-4-1-fix-wi-fi-802-1x-macbook-m5\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia macOS Tahoe 26.4.1: fix Wi‑Fi 802.1X per MacBook M5\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato macOS Tahoe 26.4.1, aggiornamento minore che risolve un problema di connessione Wi‑Fi 802.1X sui modelli MacBook Air e MacBook Pro con chip M5.\",\"categoryName\":\"macOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"macos\",\"categoryId\":100,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14195,\"date\":\"2026-04-11T14:59:51+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-11T12:59:51+00:00\",\"slug\":\"limite-carica-batteria-macbook-macos-tahoe-26-4\",\"title\":\"Come impostare un limite di carica per far durare di più la batteria del MacBook\",\"excerpt\":\"In macOS Tahoe 26.4 Apple introduce per la prima volta su Mac la funzione “Charge Limit”, che consente di fermare la ricarica a una percentuale scelta (80–100%).\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/macos-26-4-charge-limit-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-26-4-charge-limit\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14002,\"date\":\"2026-03-24T19:42:19+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-24T18:42:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-26-4-disponibile-safari-barra-schede-compatta-limiti-carica\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.4 disponibile: barra schede compatta in Safari e limiti di carica\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia macOS Tahoe 26.4 con barra schede compatta in Safari, nuova funzione Limite di carica (80–100%), emoji aggiuntive e avvisi per app che smetteranno di funzionare.\",\"categoryName\":\"macOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"macos\",\"categoryId\":100,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS Tahoe Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13793,\"date\":\"2026-03-10T00:04:04+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-12T20:08:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-4-beta-nuovi-emoji\",\"title\":\"L'ultima beta di iOS 26.4 aggiunge nuovi caratteri emoji\",\"excerpt\":\"La quarta beta di iOS 26.4, iPadOS 26.4 e macOS Tahoe 26.4 introduce nove nuovi caratteri emoji.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Latest-iOS-26.4-Beta-Adds-New-Emoji-Characters-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Latest iOS Beta Adds New Emoji Characters Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":11,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13458,\"date\":\"2026-02-28T13:08:39+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-28T12:45:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-tutte-le-voci\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: Tutte le voci finora\",\"excerpt\":\"macOS 27 è ancora lontano, ma ci sono già alcune voci riguardanti il prossimo aggiornamento software.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/macOS-27-Feature-Blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS Feature Blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":38,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13193,\"date\":\"2026-02-12T03:43:31+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-13T18:43:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-macos-tahoe-26-3\",\"title\":\"Apple Rilascia macOS Tahoe 26.3\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato macOS Tahoe 26.3, il terzo aggiornamento principale del sistema operativo macOS Tahoe, focalizzandosi su bug fix e aggiornamenti di sicurezza.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS Tahoe Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":37,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13183,\"date\":\"2026-02-12T03:32:20+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-12T18:47:29+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-3-caratteristiche\",\"title\":\"Caratteristiche di iOS 26.3: Tutte le novità\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato iOS 26.3, introducendo alcune nuove funzionalità, tra cui un nuovo strumento di trasferimento verso Android e opzioni di personalizzazione per la schermata di blocco.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/iOS-26.3-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":63,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13083,\"date\":\"2026-02-09T01:47:11+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-09T20:47:20+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-macbook-pro-marzo\",\"title\":\"I nuovi MacBook Pro potrebbero arrivare a marzo\",\"excerpt\":\"I nuovi modelli di MacBook Pro con chip M5 Pro e M5 Max potrebbero arrivare già lunedì 2 marzo, secondo Mark Gurman di Bloomberg.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/14-inch-MacBook-Pro-Keyboard-768x438.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"inch MacBook Pro Keyboard\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":42,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12072,\"date\":\"2025-12-20T19:59:24+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-12-20T18:59:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"utilizza-edge-light-videochiamate-macos\",\"title\":\"Utilizza Edge Light per Migliorare le Videochiamate in macOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha introdotto Edge Light in macOS Tahoe 26.2, una nuova funzionalità che trasforma il display del Mac in una luce virtuale per videochiamate.\",\"categoryName\":\"macOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"macos\",\"categoryId\":100,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/12/apple-edge-light-macos-tahoe-26-2-768x497.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple edge light macos tahoe\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":103,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":11104,\"date\":\"2025-11-13T19:40:56+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-13T18:40:56+00:00\",\"slug\":\"cinque-anni-apple-silicon-confronto-m1-m5\",\"title\":\"Cinque Anni di Apple Silicon: Confronto delle Prestazioni tra M1 e M5\",\"excerpt\":\"Oggi segna il quinto anniversario del chip Apple silicon che ha sostituito i chip Intel nella linea Mac di Apple. Un confronto tra le prestazioni dei chip M1 e M5.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/m1-chip-slide-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"m chip slide\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":134,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":10361,\"date\":\"2025-10-15T10:41:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-10-15T08:41:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-26-1-beta-pro-display-xdr-2\",\"title\":\"macOS 26.1 Beta Indica un Pro Display XDR 2 con Telecamera Center Stage\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato la terza beta di macOS 26.1, suggerendo un possibile Pro Display XDR 2 con telecamera integrata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/10/Pro-Display-XDR-Black-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Pro Display XDR Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":110,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9949,\"date\":\"2025-09-26T10:36:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-09-26T08:36:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"whatsapp-traduzione-messaggi-ios\",\"title\":\"WhatsApp Introduce la Traduzione dei Messaggi su iOS in 19 Lingue\",\"excerpt\":\"WhatsApp ha annunciato il lancio della sua nuova funzionalità di traduzione, consentendo agli utenti di tradurre i messaggi nella loro lingua preferita direttamente all'interno dell'app.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/09/Whatsapp-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Whatsapp Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":175,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9684,\"date\":\"2025-09-16T10:20:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-09-16T08:20:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-ora-disponibile-2\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe Ora Disponibile con Design Liquid Glass, App Telefono, Azioni Spotlight e Altro\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato macOS Tahoe 26, l'ultima versione del sistema operativo macOS, disponibile come aggiornamento gratuito per i Mac compatibili.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/09/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS Tahoe Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":187,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9580,\"date\":\"2025-09-13T01:51:08+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-09-12T23:51:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-26-in-arrivo-lunedi-ecco-le-novita\",\"title\":\"watchOS 26 in Arrivo Lunedì: Ecco le Novità\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 26 sarà rilasciato lunedì 15 settembre, con novità come Sleep Score e Hypertension Notifications, accessibili anche su modelli precedenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/09/watchos-26-gradient-light-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos gradient light\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":164,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9136,\"date\":\"2025-06-21T15:25:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-06-21T13:25:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-presenta-macos-26-tahoe-tutte-le-novita\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta macOS 26 Tahoe: tutte le novità\",\"excerpt\":\"Durante il keynote d’apertura della WWDC 2025, Apple ha svelato macOS 26 Tahoe, il nuovo sistema operativo per Mac che porta con sé un importante restyling visivo e funzionale. Con Tahoe, Apple punta a unificare l’esperienza d’uso su tutte le sue piattaforme, ma senza rinunciare a specificità pensate per il mondo desktop. Il nome “Tahoe”…\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/06/Apple-WWDC25-macOS-Tahoe-26-hero-250609_big.jpg.large_2x-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple WWDC macOS Tahoe hero big jpg large x\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136c